00:51:04.924 --> 00:51:05.883 line:77%
<c.yellow>¿Qué dices?</c>

00:51:06.792 --> 00:51:07.783 line:77%
<c.yellow>Estás loco.</c>

00:51:07.784 --> 00:51:08.744 line:77%
<c.yellow>Estás loco,</c>

00:51:09.238 --> 00:51:10.328 line:75%
